      "spokenText": "Activity one.",
      "audioBytes": 20352
    },
    {
      "textId": "pg023_n0005",
      "visibleTextSha256": "300e43b19c52b7f4c5636efdddeaa46c00006686a8af8c102f6e4802a4751c7e",
      "spokenText": "Write down what you learn when you go to places of prayer.",
      "audioBytes": 64512
    },
    {
      "textId": "pg023_n0007",
      "visibleTextSha256": "1c0ad5fdf7d5a485c341ec292bab1054ffb1130a4b790a45c76ec236d171eaa4",
      "spokenText": "Read the story and answer the questions that follows.",
      "audioBytes": 57600
    },
    {
      "textId": "pg023_n0009",
      "visibleTextSha256": "b9451901e8fcffdb589d148d2ad4421bf338b23f9b55df5a9df07794aac8dafe",
      "spokenText": "At Ah-mah-nee Primary School there were three pyoo-puhls named Foo-rah-ha, Too-mah-ee-nee and Bah-rah-kah.",
      "audioBytes": 128640
    },
    {
      "textId": "pg023_n0010",
      "visibleTextSha256": "a044ae7819f6ff39981b08354c2e878e70bf278e9ffe87c403ec9d6859ef588e",
      "spokenText": "These pyoo-puhls were in Standard Two and had different beliefs.",
      "audioBytes": 71040
    },
    {
      "textId": "pg023_n0011",
      "visibleTextSha256": "776ec1d9ffb2be374108e7db1e06cf2fdb13f1742346b6d595656cb8536e91c0",
      "spokenText": "They attended different sessions in school, including religious.",
      "audioBytes": 69504
    },
    {
      "textId": "pg023_n0012",
      "visibleTextSha256": "05d9d3221a367b6df0f4f908f323c7f45f008fd6dd4bc4fa1f3dc32c73f9061e",
      "spokenText": "In the religious session they learn to be loving, patient, cooperative and care for others.",
      "audioBytes": 97152
    },
    {
      "textId": "pg023_n0013",
      "visibleTextSha256": "fcfcaedeea39ba5a3e316eb8e9266560e0a4980eeaec0699d193f4e28f250b8a",
      "spokenText": "Foo-rah-ha and Too-mah-ee-nee were obedient and eager to attend all sessions.",
      "audioBytes": 91008
    },
    {
      "textId": "pg023_n0014",
      "visibleTextSha256": "daa7aff82e19ff30c265a4f68e9727038f82cde2efc462ab223ccfaff6f3032d",
      "spokenText": "Bah-rah-kah did not like to participate in religious sessions.",
      "audioBytes": 71424
    },
    {
      "textId": "pg023_n0015",
      "visibleTextSha256": "b7ea88698cd6bab946c25ea61191100884aeeb71f3e5a12760718fc8c352fa34",
      "spokenText": "During the session, he would rather run away and hide behind the classroom.",
      "audioBytes": 77952
    },
    {
      "textId": "pg023_n0016",
      "visibleTextSha256": "a8c2a5af2871e6ed9ba5a36b4a1e5201620e2ab24739a7d921ece0efb237ffc2",
      "spokenText": "Because of this behaviour, Bah-rah-kah was naughty, selfish and did not care about others.",
      "audioBytes": 104832
    },
    {
      "textId": "pg023_n0017",
      "visibleTextSha256": "59490fadcc94b4e56c25c28789bf5f5757a817612e5e3331e7a503d8a267413c",
      "spokenText": "One day, the teacher told them the effects of not attending religious sessions.",
      "audioBytes": 86016
    },
    {
      "textId": "pg023_n0018",
      "visibleTextSha256": "4a2f5f1fc7a62e24613200cd6f6c2ae6df7b7df3dcee997af0692db2ffc36dba",
      "spokenText": "The teacher said, If you miss the religious sessions you cannot learn good things for the community. Therefore, you will not be a well-behaved child and not accepted by the community.",
      "audioBytes": 193920
    },
    {
      "textId": "pg023_n0019",
      "visibleTextSha256": "033fb69fa59c6e0f596d32c9dcd8863f46adea6d1c158332905205b75669265c",
      "spokenText": "Foo-rah-ha and Too-mah-ee-nee decided to talk to Bah-rah-kah.",
      "audioBytes": 77568
    },
    {
      "textId": "pg023_n0020",
      "visibleTextSha256": "c37674b2534b2083e1ea80c2020177b76c8a3b201e32c42c9cbf255b19227bee",
      "spokenText": "They advised him to attend religious sessions to learn many good things for the community.",
      "audioBytes": 90624
    },
    {
      "textId": "pg023_n0021",
      "visibleTextSha256": "e63eb577c6381db07b247de36d8f040584c1cccdebcb404998406c2f876c8b7c",
      "spokenText": "Bah-rah-kah agreed and started attending religious",
      "audioBytes": 57216
    },
    {
